  "instructions": [
    "Heat the niter kibbeh in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until it's translucent.",
    "Add the ginger and garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, turmeric, and cayenne pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken and cook until it's browned on all sides.",
    "Add the orange juice, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the stew to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cook for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the beurre monte and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Season the stew with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stew hot, wrapped in a lotus leaf if desired.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh cilantro, if desired."
